会译 (HuiYi)
===========

Parts of this software are ported from Cicada (知了), https://github.com/wquguru/cicada,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Ported logic (rewritten in C#): the Ling client
conventions, meeting notes prompt and parser, heard-text cleanup and joining, meeting-end
detection, translation chain, speaker clustering and labelling rules, speaker name guessing, and the
session record format, together with their unit tests. The user interface is this project's own design.
"Cicada" and "知了" are names of that project; this software is not affiliated with it.

Third-party components, downloaded or referenced, not bundled in source:
- sherpa-onnx (k2-fsa), Apache-2.0
- SenseVoice small model (FunAudioLLM), via sherpa-onnx model releases
- Silero VAD, MIT
- 3D-Speaker CAM++ speaker model (zh-cn, 16k common), Apache-2.0, via sherpa-onnx model releases
- NAudio, MIT
- H.NotifyIcon, MIT
- VB-Audio Virtual Cable: installed by the user from vb-audio.com, never redistributed
